### Bundled Music & Third-Party Exclusions

This MIT License applies to the VSXSuite software and source code only.

1. **Bundled Music Tracks (`music/`)**: Audio tracks included in the `music/` directory (and any compiled build output thereof) are excluded from this MIT License. All rights to those musical works remain with their respective artists and creators (`ansimuz`, `DesertDev`, `Ruskerdax`) under the terms under which they were originally released.
2. **Third-Party Libraries & Shaders**: Third-party dependencies and adapted shader algorithms remain governed by their respective licenses as detailed in `THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md`.
